 "notes": [
  "Only destinations the airport itself lists: the names are the airport's own Korean destination names, exactly as the flight feed stores them in airport_flights.airport_code. All 164 names seen in the stored departures of 2026-09-23..30 are in this list (168 entries).",
  "name <-> IATA code: the destination list of the airport's own flight-status page (option value = code, label = name). code <-> city and airport: IATA airport code search, one query per code. Both read 2026-09-30 by the read-only evidence runs of e2e-production/destination-evidence.spec.ts (Production Visual Check runs 36714424696, 36716515897 and the IATA run on branch work/airport-evidence).",
  "country: neither page states it. It is KORETAIL's review of the IATA-confirmed city and airport (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2; Guam GU and the Northern Mariana Islands MP keep their own codes). Nothing is inferred from an airline, a flight number or a passenger's nationality.",
  "groupOf puts every country in exactly one group, so group totals never double count. Turkey is grouped with Europe; Georgia, Central and South Asia and Mongolia with other Asia; Hawaii and Alaska (US) with the Americas; Guam and Saipan with Oceania and the Pacific; Gimhae, Daegu and Jeju are domestic legs.",
  "A stored name that is not in this list is shown as region not confirmed."
 ],
